From: buntOS contributors
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: input: mediatek,mt6779-keypad: add MT6897

The MT6897 keypad controller works with the MT6779 driver. Lenovo's
TB375FC tablet has its volume down key on it.
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/mediatek,mt6779-keypad.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/mediatek,mt6779-keypad.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/mediatek,mt6779-keypad.yaml
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/mediatek,mt6779-keypad.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/mediatek,mt6779-keypad.yaml
@@ -27,6 +27,7 @@
       - items:
           - enum:
               - mediatek,mt6873-keypad
+              - mediatek,mt6897-keypad
               - mediatek,mt8183-keypad
               - mediatek,mt8365-keypad
               - mediatek,mt8516-keypad
